{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-selectors","title":"现代选择器与嵌套","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/modern/modern-selectors","wordCount":1264,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"现代选择器与嵌套\">现代选择器与嵌套</h1><p>二十年来 CSS 选择器只能往下、往后选——选中后代、选中后面的兄弟，却永远无法让一个元素根据它的子元素或后续状态变化。&quot;当卡片里有图片时给卡片加边框&quot;这种需求，过去只能靠 JavaScript 加类名。2023 年起进入 Baseline 的 <code>:has()</code> 打破了这个限制，配合 <code>:is()</code>、<code>:where()</code> 和原生嵌套，CSS 的选择能力第一次接近了预处理器，却无需任何构建步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一篇的选择器分三组：<code>:has()</code> 是&quot;父选择器/关系选择器&quot;，让元素依据后代或兄弟的存在与状态被选中；<code>:is()</code> 和 <code>:where()</code> 是&quot;逻辑组合选择器&quot;，简化冗长的选择器列表并精确控制优先级；原生嵌套（nesting）则让规则可以写进另一条规则内部。三者都深度牵涉<a href=\"../foundations/cascade-specificity\">优先级</a>，是理解它们的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[现代选择器] --&gt; B[关系选择器 :has&lt;br/&gt;依据后代/兄弟选择]&#10;  A --&gt; C[逻辑组合 :is / :where&lt;br/&gt;合并选择器列表]&#10;  A --&gt; D[原生嵌套&lt;br/&gt;规则内写规则]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[向上选择 父依赖子]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[向后依赖 状态联动]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[:is 取最高优先级]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[:where 优先级恒为 0]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[&amp; 引用父选择器]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[嵌套不提升优先级]\">flowchart TD\n  A[现代选择器] --&gt; B[关系选择器 :has&lt;br/&gt;依据后代/兄弟选择]\n  A --&gt; C[逻辑组合 :is / :where&lt;br/&gt;合并选择器列表]\n  A --&gt; D[原生嵌套&lt;br/&gt;规则内写规则]\n  B --&gt; B1[向上选择 父依赖子]\n  B --&gt; B2[向后依赖 状态联动]\n  C --&gt; C1[:is 取最高优先级]\n  C --&gt; C2[:where 优先级恒为 0]\n  D --&gt; D1[&amp; 引用父选择器]\n  D --&gt; D2[嵌套不提升优先级]</pre><p>下表给出三类选择器对优先级的影响——这是它们最容易被误用的地方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择器</th>\n<th>优先级计算</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>:has(...)</code></td>\n<td>取参数中最高优先级</td>\n<td>父/兄弟依赖样式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:is(...)</code></td>\n<td>取参数中最高优先级</td>\n<td>合并选择器、缩短书写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:where(...)</code></td>\n<td>恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低优先级基础样式、库默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:not(...)</code></td>\n<td>取参数中最高优先级</td>\n<td>排除特定元素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"has-迟来二十年的父选择器\">:has()：迟来二十年的父选择器</h2><p><code>:has()</code> 让选择器能依据其内部或后续匹配的内容来选中目标。它被称为父选择器，但能力远不止&quot;选父&quot;——它能表达后代依赖、兄弟依赖、状态联动等过去必须靠脚本的关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card:has(img) {&#10;  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);&#10;} /* 含图片的卡片才加边框 */&#10;label:has(+ input:required)::after {&#10;  content: &#39; *&#39;;&#10;} /* 必填项标签加星号 */&#10;form:has(:invalid) .submit {&#10;  opacity: 0.5;&#10;} /* 表单有非法字段时禁用提交样式 */&#10;.gallery:has(figure:hover) figure:not(:hover) {&#10;  opacity: 0.5;&#10;} /* 悬停某图，其余变暗 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card:has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> solid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--color-border</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 含图片的卡片才加边框 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">label</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">::after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' *'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 必填项标签加星号 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">form</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:invalid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 表单有非法字段时禁用提交样式 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.gallery:has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">figure</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">figure</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 悬停某图，其余变暗 */</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一例尤其能说明它的威力：纯 CSS 实现&quot;悬停聚焦&quot;效果，过去要监听 <code>mouseover</code> 加类名。<code>:has()</code> 的优先级取其参数中最高者，例如 <code>:has(#id)</code> 会带上 ID 的优先级。它在 2023 年底成为 Baseline，2026 年所有主流浏览器完全支持。<code>:has()</code> 让大量原本要写 JavaScript 的状态联动回归纯样式，是 <a href=\"animations-effects\">CSS 替代脚本</a> 这条主线的代表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"is-与-where-合并与降权\">:is() 与 :where()：合并与降权</h2><p><code>:is()</code> 把冗长的选择器列表压缩成一条。下面两段等价，但后者可读性高得多：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 啰嗦 */&#10;header h1,&#10;header h2,&#10;main h1,&#10;main h2 {&#10;  margin: 0;&#10;}&#10;/* 用 :is() */&#10;:is(header, main) :is(h1, h2) {&#10;  margin: 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 啰嗦 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\"> h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 用 :is() */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:is</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  margin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>:is()</code> 取参数列表中优先级最高的那个作为整体优先级。<code>:where()</code> 语法完全相同，但优先级<strong>恒为零</strong>——这是它最有价值的特性。库作者用 <code>:where()</code> 写默认样式，使用者无需任何额外优先级就能覆盖；这正是<a href=\"../foundations/cascade-specificity\">基础章</a>提到的&quot;刻意降低优先级的工具&quot;。它与<a href=\"cascade-layers-scope\">层叠层</a>是治理优先级的两种互补手段：<code>:where()</code> 在选择器层面降权，<code>@layer</code> 在层级层面排序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 组件库默认样式：用 :where 让使用者轻松覆盖 */&#10;:where(.btn) {&#10;  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;&#10;  border-radius: 6px;&#10;}&#10;.btn {&#10;  padding: 1rem;&#10;} /* 普通单类即可覆盖，无需更高优先级 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 组件库默认样式：用 :where 让使用者轻松覆盖 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.btn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  border-radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.btn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 普通单类即可覆盖，无需更高优先级 */</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"原生嵌套-无需预处理器的层级书写\">原生嵌套：无需预处理器的层级书写</h2><p>原生 CSS 嵌套让规则可以写进另一条规则内部，用 <code>&amp;</code> 引用父选择器——这是过去 Sass/Less 的招牌特性，2023 年起原生支持，2026 年 caniuse 显示全球支持率已超 90%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card {&#10;  padding: 1rem;&#10;  &amp; .title {&#10;    font-weight: 600;&#10;  } /* 等价于 .card .title */&#10;  &amp;:hover {&#10;    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);&#10;  }&#10;  &amp; + .card {&#10;    margin-top: 1rem;&#10;  }&#10;  @media (min-width: 600px) {&#10;    padding: 2rem;&#10;  } /* 嵌套媒体查询 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  padding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26; .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    font-weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 等价于 .card .title */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">:hover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    box-shadow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--shadow-md</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    margin-top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @media</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min-width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    padding: 2rem;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 嵌套媒体查询 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>嵌套有两个常被误解的点。其一，嵌套<strong>不会自动提升优先级</strong>——<code>.card { &amp; .title {} }</code> 的优先级就是 <code>.card .title</code> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,2,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与平铺写法完全一致，不会因为嵌套层数增加而膨胀。其二，浏览器对裸标签名嵌套（如直接写 <code>h2 {}</code> 而非 <code>&amp; h2</code>）的解析有历史差异，现代规范已统一支持，但显式写 <code>&amp;</code> 仍是最稳妥的习惯。原生嵌套配合 <code>:has()</code>、<code>:where()</code>，让纯 CSS 的表达力接近 <a href=\"../architecture/css-in-js-modules\">CSS Modules 与原子化方案</a> 所依赖的预处理器，是&quot;原生追平工具&quot;的又一例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优先级陷阱与最佳实践\">优先级陷阱与最佳实践</h2><p>这一组选择器最大的风险是无意中抬高优先级。<code>:has()</code>、<code>:is()</code>、<code>:not()</code> 都取参数里最高的优先级，所以 <code>:is(#main, .sidebar)</code> 会意外带上 ID 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，哪怕你本意只想选 <code>.sidebar</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>实际优先级</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>:is(#main, .x)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>被 ID 拉高，难覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>:where(#main, .x)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0,0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>安全，但谁都能覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>article:has(h2)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>取决于参数与主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp; .title</code>（嵌套）</td>\n<td>等于平铺</td>\n<td>无额外提升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践建议：写库或基础样式时优先用 <code>:where()</code> 保持低优先级；用 <code>:is()</code> 缩短书写时警惕参数里的 ID；用 <code>:has()</code> 做状态联动时记得它会带上参数优先级。把这些选择器与<a href=\"cascade-layers-scope\">层叠层</a>结合，能在保持表达力的同时让整套样式的优先级始终可控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>:has()</code> 是迟来的父/关系选择器，让元素依据后代或兄弟的存在与状态被选中，把大量状态联动从 JavaScript 拉回纯 CSS；2023 年起 Baseline。</li>\n<li><code>:is()</code> 合并选择器列表、取参数最高优先级；<code>:where()</code> 语法相同但优先级恒为零，是库默认样式与刻意降权的利器。</li>\n<li>原生嵌套用 <code>&amp;</code> 引用父选择器、可嵌套媒体查询，2026 支持率超 90%；它不自动提升优先级，显式写 <code>&amp;</code> 最稳妥。</li>\n<li>主要陷阱是 <code>:has()</code>/<code>:is()</code>/<code>:not()</code> 会取参数中最高优先级，易被 ID 意外拉高。</li>\n<li>这组选择器与 <code>@layer</code> 互补治理优先级（选择器降权 vs 层级排序），共同让纯 CSS 表达力追平预处理器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"现代选择器与嵌套","id":"现代选择器与嵌套"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":":has()：迟来二十年的父选择器","id":"has-迟来二十年的父选择器"},{"level":2,"text":":is() 与 :where()：合并与降权","id":"is-与-where-合并与降权"},{"level":2,"text":"原生嵌套：无需预处理器的层级书写","id":"原生嵌套-无需预处理器的层级书写"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级陷阱与最佳实践","id":"优先级陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"层叠层与作用域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/modern/cascade-layers-scope"},"next":{"title":"动画与视觉效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/modern-css-architecture/modern/animations-effects"}}